    "detailed_description": "Learn over 10,000 pieces of vocabulary and 2150 Kanjis in Kanji Islands through different game mode:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Kana training: Start by learning Hiraganas and Katakanas to warm up for what's to come<br></li><li>Lessons: 100 lessons with increasing difficulty to learn all the vocabulary and Kanjis you need to read Japanese<br></li><li>Challenges: Go through themed challenges to check your progress in the game<br></li><li>Quick play: When you just want to go through what you already know, you can play retake vocabulary from unlocked lessons or train on your recent mistakes.</li></ul>",
